# | Advantech ADAM-6018 / ADAM-6018+ — 8-Channel Thermocouple Input Module (Ethernet/Modbus TCP)
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-6000-modbus.pdf (Appendix B.2)
# | - 8-channel thermocouple input; type selectable per channel.
# | - ADAM-6018 also has 2 digital outputs (DO ch 0-1 at FC01 addr 16-17).
# | - ADAM-6018+ has no digital outputs.
# | - Modbus TCP (Ethernet), unit identifier = 1.
# | - FC01 addr 16-17 (00017-00018): DO value ch 0-1 (R/W) — ADAM-6018 only.
# | - FC02 addr 120-127: Open-circuit/burnout flag ch 0-7 (R).
# | - FC02 addr 130-138: High alarm flag ch 0-7, avg (R).
# | - FC02 addr 140-148: Low alarm flag ch 0-7, avg (R).
# | - FC03 addr 0-7: AI raw ch 0-7 (u16, 0-65535=full scale) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 8: AI average raw (u16) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 10-17: Historical max AI ch 0-7 (u16) (R).
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Advantech
@model=ADAM-6018
@description=8-channel thermocouple input over Modbus TCP. FC03 addr 0-7: u16 raw (0-65535=full scale); addr 30,32,...44 pairs: f32 IEEE754 direct °C. Historical max/min at addr 10-28. ADAM-6018 adds 2 DO at FC01 coil addr 16-17.
